## Key finding: `isFormerDepositMechanismDisabled` already exists and is fully implemented

The method is already present in `Spec.java` (line 938-940) and delegates to a working Electra implementation. No implementation is needed — unless the intent is a refactor. Details below.

---

### 1. How `Spec.java` delegates to `SpecVersion` / milestone logic

`Spec` resolves a `SpecVersion` from either a slot or a state, then calls into that version's helpers.

`/workspace/repo/ethereum/spec/src/main/java/tech/pegasys/teku/spec/Spec.java`
