- Naming note: the codebase uses **`DepositReceiptsStartIndex`** (older EIP-6110 wording `deposit_receipts_start_index`), NOT `DepositRequestsStartIndex`. Grep for `depositRequestsStartIndex`/`DEPOSIT_REQUESTS_START_INDEX` returned nothing. The field enum is `BeaconStateFields.DEPOSIT_RECEIPTS_START_INDEX` (`BeaconStateFields.java:73`), field index constant `DEPOSIT_RECEIPTS_START_INDEX = 28` (`BeaconStateSchemaElectra.java:44`).

### 3. Predicate on MiscHelpers / MiscHelpersElectra

The predicate lives on `MiscHelpers`, overridden in `MiscHelpersElectra` (not on `Predicates`).

